And this is the file into which you can put your hooks. And we're going to tell this

02:56.639 --> 03:01.719
hook that we want the event to be when, when Claude is stopping. And we're going to tell this hook that we want the event to be when Claude is stopping,

03:01.719 --> 03:03.560
