03:10.099 --> 03:12.039
The three different things you could do is

03:12.039 --> 03:13.240
run a shell command,

03:13.240 --> 03:16.340
just give a command that needs to be run at that point.

03:16.340 --> 03:18.479
You could make a prompt to Claude,

03:18.479 --> 03:21.159
it could be some instructions you want to give Claude,

03:21.159 --> 03:22.639
or it could be an agent you want to give Claude or it could be an agent

03:22.639 --> 03:29.159
You want Claude to spawn a sub agent to do something and and that way it's kept off the context

03:29.199 --> 03:34.840
Those are the three things that you could you could have triggered by an event as part of a hook

03:35.159 --> 03:37.199
That's the terminology. That's how it fits together

